Z||000008||Mr. P-body||08-06-2001||05:10 PM||||  Starting fluid is a baaaaaaaaaaaad idea!!!<BR>  If you truly have to, use WD40. Starting fluid (ether) does not compress so if you have a timing problem you could crack a head.  stuff is WAY flamable too. Saw a guy blow an air filter clean off one time with it.<P>------------------<BR>Every dog should have a boy<BR>Sherman.<p>[This message has been edited by Mr. P-body (edited 08-06-2001).]||||reg||1
